  "title": "Duas After Ziyarat of Imam Ali (a.s.) & After Nafilah — Najaf",
  "data": "Post-Ziyarah Prayer & Dua\nSalat -Dua after Ziarat Offer a six unit prayer\nIn the first two units, which are intended for visiting the tomb of Imam `Ali Amir al-Mu'minin (‘a), you may recite [Surah al-Fatihah](A5) and [Surah al-Rahman](A59) (No. 55) at the first unit, and recite [Surah al-Fatihah](A5) and [Surah Yasin](A40) (No. 36) in the second.\nyou may then say the famous Tasbih al-Zahra' (sa), implore for Almighty Allah’s forgiveness (istighfar), pray Him to grant you your personal needs, and then say the following\nاَللَّهُمَّ إِنِّي صَلَّيْتُ هَاتَيْنِ ٱلرَّكْعَتَيْنِ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE SALLAYTO HAATAYNIR RAK-A’TAYNE\nO Allah, I have offered these two units of prayer,\nهَدِيَّةً مِنِّي إِلَىٰ سَيِّدِي وَمَوْلاَيَ\nHADIYYATAM MINNEE ELAA SAYYEDEE WA MAWLAAYA\nas present from me to my master and chief:\nوَلِيِّكَ وَأَخِي رَسُولِكَ\nWALIYYEKA WA AKHEE RASOOLEKA\nYour intimate servant, the brother of Your Messenger,\nأَمِيرِ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ\nAMEERIL MOAMENEENA\nthe Commander of the Faithful\nوَسَيِّدِ ٱلْوَصِيّينَ\nWA SAYYEDIL WASIYYEENA\nand the chief of the Prophets’ successors;\nعَلِيِّ بْنِ أَبِي طَالِبٍ\nA’LIYYIBNE ABEE TAALEBIN\nnamely, `Ali the son of Abu-Talib,\nصَلَوَاتُ ٱللَّهِ عَلَيْهِ وَعَلَىٰ آلِهِ\nSALAWAATUL LAAHE A’LAYHE WA A’LAA AALEHI\nmay Allah’s blessings be upon him and his household.\nاَللَّهُمَّ فَصَلِّ عَلَىٰ مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA FASALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALE MOHAMMADIN\nSo, O Allah, (please do) send blessings upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَتَقَبَّلَهَا مِنِّي\nWA TAQABBALAHAA MINNEE\naccept that prayer from me,\nوَٱجْزِنِي عَلَىٰ ذٰلِكَ جَزَاءَ ٱلْمُحْسِنينَ\nWAJ ZENEE A’LAA ZAALEKA JAZAAA-AL MOHSENEENA\nand confer upon me with the reward that You give to the good-doers.\nاَللَّهُمَّ لَكَ صَلَّيْتُ\nALLAAHUMMA LAKA SALLAYTO\nO Allah, to You have I offered prayer,\nوَلَكَ رَكَعْتُ\nWA LAKA RAKA’TO\ngenuflected,\nوَلَكَ سَجَدْتُ\nWA LAKA SAJADTO\nand prostrated myself;\nوَحْدَكَ لاََ شَرِيكَ لَكَ\nWAHDAKA LAA SHAREEKA LAKA\nto You alone without associating anyone with You,\nلأَنَّهُ لاََ تَكُونُ ٱلصَّلاَةُ\nLE-ANNAHU LAA TAKOONUS SALAATO\nbecause prayers,\nوَٱلرُّكُوعُ وَٱلسُّجُودُ إِلاَّ لَكَ\nWAR ROKOO-O’ WAS SOJOODO ILLAA LAKA\ngenuflections, and prostrations are submitted to none save You,\nلأَنَّكَ أَنْتَ ٱللَّهُ لاََ إِلٰهَ إِلاَّ أَنْتَ\nLE-ANNAKA ANTAL LAAHO LAA ELAAHA ILLAA ANTA\nbecause You are Allah; there is no god save You.\nاَللَّهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَىٰ مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALE MOHAMMADIN\nO Allah, (please do) bless Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَتَقَبَّلْ مِنِّي زِيَارَتِي\nWA TAQABBAL MINNEE ZEYAARATEE\nadmit my visit,\nوَأَعْطِنِي سُؤْلِي\nWA A-A’TENEE SOALEE\nand respond to my requests\nبِمُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِهِ ٱلطَّاهِرِينَ\nBE-MOHAMMADINW WA AALEHIT TAAHEREENA\nin the name of Muhammad and his Household—the immaculate ones.\nYou may then provide the other four units as present to Prophet Adam(as) and Prophet Noah.(as)\nYou may then prostrate yourself for thanksgiving (sajdat al-shukr) and say the following words:\nاَللَّهُمَّ إِلَيْكَ تَوَجَّهْتُ\nALLAAHUMMA ELAYKA TAWAJJAHTO\nO Allah, to You do I direct my face,\nوَبِكَ ٱعْتَصَمْتُ\nWA BEKA’ TASAMTO\nto You do I resort,\nوَعَلَيْكَ تَوَكَّلْتُ\nWA A’LAYKA TAWAKKALTO\nand on You do I rely.\nاَللَّهُمَّ أَنْتَ ثِقَتِي وَرَجَائِي\nALLAAHUMMA ANTA SEQATEE WA RAJAAA-EE\nO Allah, You are my trust and my hope;\nفَٱكْفِنِي مَا أَهَمَّنِي وَمَا لاََ يُهِمُّنِي\nFAKFENEE MAA AHAMMANEE WA MAA LAA YOHIMMONEE\nso, (please do) save me from whatever concerns me, whatever does not concern me,\nوَمَا أَنْتَ أَعْلَمُ بِهِ مِنِّي\nWA MAA ANTA A-A’LAMO BEHI MINNEE\nand whatever You know more than I do.\nعَزَّ جَارُكَ\nA’ZZA JAAROKA\nCertainly, protected is he who lies under Your protection,\nوَجَلَّ ثَنَاؤُكَ\nWA JALLA SANAAA-OKA\nglory be to Your praise,\nوَلاَ إِلٰهَ غَيْرُكَ\nWA LAA ELAAHA GHAYROKA\nand there is no deity save You.\nصَلِّ عَلَىٰ مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِ مُحَمَّد\nSALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALE MOHAMMADIN\n(Please do) send blessings upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَقَرِّبْ فَرَجَهُمْ\nWA QARRIB FARAJAHUM\nand hasten their Relief.\nYou may then put your right cheek on the ground and say the following words:\nإِرْحَمْ ذُلِّي بَيْنَ يَدَيْكَ\nIRHAM ZULLEE BAYNA YADAYKA\n(Please do) have mercy on my humiliation before You,\nوَتَضَرُّعِي إِلَيْكَ\nWA TAZARRO-E’E ELAYKA\non my earnest imploring to You,\nوَوَحْشَتِي مِنَ ٱلنَّاسِ\nWA WAHSHATEE MENAN NAASE\non my loneliness among people,\nوَأُنْسِي بِكَ\nWA UNSEE BEKA\nand on my amiability with You.\nيَا كَرِيمُ يَا كَرِيمُ يَا كَرِيمُ\nYAA KAREEMO YAA KAREEMO YAA KAREEMO\nO All-generous! O All-generous! O All-generous!\nYou may then put your left cheek on the ground and say the following words:\nلاََ إِلٰهَ إِلاَّ أَنْتَ رَبِّي حَقّاً حَقّاً\nLAA ELAAHA ILLAA ANTA RABBEE HAQQAN HAQQAN\nThere is no god save You, my Lord; truly, truly.\nسَجَدْتُ لَكَ يَا رَبِّ تَعَبُّداً وَرِقّاً\nSAJADTO LAKA YAA RABBE TA-A’BBODANW WA RIQQAN\nO Lord, I prostrate myself before You as sign of my worshipfulness and servitude to You.\nاَللَّهُمَّ إِنَّ عَمَلِي ضَعيفٌ فَضَاعِفْهُ لِي\nALLAAHUMMA INNA A’MALEE ZA-E’EFUN FAZAA-I’FHO LEE\nO Allah, my deed is certainly feeble; so, (please do) grant it strength by increasing it many times,\nيَا كَرِيمُ يَا كَرِيمُ يَا كَرِيمُ\nYAA KAREEMO YAA KAREEMO YAA KAREEMO\nO All-generous! O All-generous! O All-generous!\nYou may then return to the state of ordinary prostration and repeat \"shukran\" one hundred times:\nشُكْراً\nSHUKRAN\nThanks.\nRecite Dua After Ziarat - Allhumma La Budda\n[Dua Alqama](E8)\nYou are also recommended to implore Almighty Allah for forgiveness as sincerely as possible, because the place you are in is the zone of forgiveness. You are recommended to beseech Almighty Allah for settling your needs as seriously as possible, because the place you are in is the zone of responding to the needs.",
